            <div class=3D"eli-subdivision" id=3D"cit_6">
               <p class=3D"oj-normal">i enlighet med det ordinarie lagstift=
ningsf=C3=B6rfarandet&nbsp;<a id=3D"ntc2-L_202602280SV.000101-E0002" href=
=3D"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/SV/TXT/HTML/?uri=3DOJ:L_2026022=
80#ntr2-L_202602280SV.000101-E0002">(<span class=3D"oj-super oj-note-tag">2=
</span>)</a>, och</p>
            </div>
